<p>After some work, the webp command was finally installed.</p>

<p>To convert other images to WebP, use the <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">cwebp</code> command (encoder); conversely, <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">dwebp</code> is the decoder.</p>

